    "Telephony": "Teileafónaíocht",
    "Credentials go on the APIs page: a \"Telnyx\" entry with its API key, or a \"Twilio\" entry with the account SID as client key and the auth token as API key. Leave blank to turn telephony off.": "Téann dintiúir ar leathanach na API: iontráil \"Telnyx\" lena eochair API, nó iontráil \"Twilio\" le SID an chuntais mar eochair chliaint agus an comhartha fíordheimhnithe mar eochair API. Fág bán chun an teileafónaíocht a mhúchadh.",
    "From number": "Uimhir an tseoltóra",
    "Your number at the provider, in E.164 form: the setup button verifies it as caller ID, and inbound calls to it are answered by the agent below.": "D'uimhir ag an soláthraí, i bhfoirm E.164: fíoraíonn an cnaipe socraithe í mar aitheantas glaoiteora, agus freagraíonn an gníomhaire thíos glaonna isteach chuici.",
    "Answer with agent": "Freagair le gníomhaire",
    "The live agent that answers incoming calls.": "An gníomhaire beo a fhreagraíonn glaonna isteach.",
    "Auto-accept after": "Glac go huathoibríoch tar éis",
    "Answer incoming calls automatically after this many seconds, unless answered or rejected first.": "Freagair glaonna isteach go huathoibríoch tar éis an líon soicindí seo, mura bhfreagraítear nó mura ndiúltaítear dóibh ar dtús.",
    "OpenAI project ID": "Aitheantas tionscadail OpenAI",
    "Calls are bridged to sip:<project id>@sip.api.openai.com.": "Déantar glaonna a dhroicheadú chuig sip:<project id>@sip.api.openai.com.",
    "Allowed countries": "Tíortha ceadaithe",
    "Countries calls may be placed to, as comma-separated ISO codes such as GB, US. Applied to the selected provider when changed, and by its setup button.": "Tíortha ar féidir glaoch orthu, mar chóid ISO scartha le camóga ar nós GB, US. Cuirtear i bhfeidhm ar an soláthraí roghnaithe é nuair a athraítear é, agus lena chnaipe socraithe.",
    "Telnyx connection ID": "Aitheantas ceangail Telnyx",
    "The Telnyx voice application calls are placed through. \"Set up Telnyx\" creates it for you; its webhook URL is kept up to date automatically.": "An feidhmchlár gutha Telnyx trína ndéantar glaonna. Cruthaíonn \"Socraigh Telnyx\" é duit; coinnítear a URL crúca gréasáin cothrom le dáta go huathoibríoch.",
    "Set up Telnyx": "Socraigh Telnyx",
    "Creates the voice application and outbound profile through the Telnyx API, then verifies the From number as caller ID by SMS code.": "Cruthaíonn sé an feidhmchlár gutha agus an phróifíl amach trí API Telnyx, ansin fíoraíonn sé uimhir an tseoltóra mar aitheantas glaoiteora le cód SMS.",
    "Set up Twilio": "Socraigh Twilio",
    "Enables the allowed countries and points the From number at the webhook through the Twilio API, then verifies the From number as caller ID with a call from Twilio if the account does not own it.": "Cumasaíonn sé na tíortha ceadaithe agus díríonn sé uimhir an tseoltóra ar an gcrúca gréasáin trí API Twilio, ansin fíoraíonn sé uimhir an tseoltóra mar aitheantas glaoiteora le glao ó Twilio mura leis an gcuntas í.",
    "Public URL": "URL poiblí",
    "Filled in automatically: a Cloudflare quick tunnel is opened to the listener whenever a provider is set, and OpenAI and the provider are pointed at it.": "Líontar go huathoibríoch é: osclaítear tollán tapa Cloudflare chuig an éisteoir nuair a shocraítear soláthraí, agus dírítear OpenAI agus an soláthraí air.",
    "This will take a while.": "Tógfaidh sé seo tamall.",
